        <UserObject label="" mermaidData="{&#xa;  &quot;data&quot;: &quot;flowchart TB\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% DEVELOPMENT\n%% ==========================\n\nA[\&quot;Developers&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Antigravity IDE&lt;br/&gt;VS Code&lt;br/&gt;Local Development\&quot;]\n\n\nB[\&quot;Git Repository&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;GitHub&lt;br/&gt;Source Control&lt;br/&gt;Branch Management\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% CI/CD\n%% ==========================\n\nC[\&quot;CI/CD Pipeline&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;GitHub Actions&lt;br/&gt;Automated workflow\&quot;]\n\n\nD[\&quot;Automated Testing&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Unit Tests&lt;br/&gt;Integration Tests&lt;br/&gt;API Tests\&quot;]\n\n\nE[\&quot;Security Scanning&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Dependency checks&lt;br/&gt;Code scanning&lt;br/&gt;Secret detection\&quot;]\n\n\nF[\&quot;Build Process&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Docker Images&lt;br/&gt;Frontend Build&lt;br/&gt;Backend Build&lt;br/&gt;Agent Build\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% REGISTRY\n%% ==========================\n\nG[\&quot;Container Registry&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Docker Images&lt;br/&gt;Version Tags&lt;br/&gt;Release Artifacts\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% ENVIRONMENTS\n%% ==========================\n\nH[\&quot;Development Environment&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Local Docker&lt;br/&gt;Testing\&quot;]\n\n\nI[\&quot;Staging Environment&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Production-like testing&lt;br/&gt;QA validation\&quot;]\n\n\nJ[\&quot;Production Environment&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Customer traffic&lt;br/&gt;High availability\&quot;]\n\n\n\n%% ==========================\n%% SERVICES\n%% ==========================\n\nK[\&quot;Frontend Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;Next.js Application\&quot;]\n\n\nL[\&quot;Backend Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;FastAPI APIs\&quot;]\n\n\nM[\&quot;Agent Service&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;LiveKit Workers&lt;br/&gt;Python Agents\&quot;]\n\n\nN[\&quot;Infrastructure Services&lt;br/&gt;&lt;br/&gt;PostgreSQL&lt;br/&gt;Redis&lt;br/